do_1       = "Build the worker packet: criteria, declared symbols' definitions, callers and callees, required tasks' introduced symbols on the feature branch, recall, and live sibling touches, fitted to the budget."
do_2       = "Build the manager packet: subtree state, conflicts, failed attempts with triage, approvals, and drift."
do_3       = "cg work update reports symbols merged upstream since the attempt began; add fixture tasks with gold symbols and a recall threshold."
